{
  "name": "ListCoreRuntimeEndpoints",
  "summary": "批量查询runtime访问方式",
  "tags": "运行时访问方式",
  "productshort": "AgentArts",
  "region_id": "cn-southwest-2",
  "paths": {
    "/v1/core/runtimes/{runtime_id}/endpoints": {
      "get": {
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-api-service-plane": "Control-plane",
        "x-sec-data-level": "L3",
        "x-api-framework": "RestfulAPI",
        "x-api-user": "IAM普通租户",
        "tags": [
          "运行时访问方式"
        ],
        "summary": "批量查询runtime访问方式",
        "description": "该接口用于根据运行时ID查询某一个具体的Agent运行时下的访问方式列表。支持分页查询。\n**适用场景:**\n根据Agent运行时ID查询该运行时的访问方式列表。",
        "operationId": "ListCoreRuntimeEndpoints",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/RuntimeId"
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n分页起始页码,默认值为1。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n1 - 1000\n**默认取值**:\n1",
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "default": 1,
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n每页记录数,默认值为10。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n10 - 100\n**默认取值**:\n10",
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 10,
            "maximum": 100,
            "default": 10,
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_key_exists",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n需要匹配的包含该标签名称的资源, 多个值通过重复参数名传递,如:tag_key_exists=env&tag_key_exists=team。\n**约束限制**:\n支持批量查询多个标签名,最多支持10个标签。\n**取值范围**:\n最小数量 1,最大数量 10\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_key_matches",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n需要匹配的包含该标签的资源,需要和tag_value_matches条件配合使用,tag_key_matches和tag_value_matches的元素个数需要一致,且标签顺序需要完全匹配,不支持空字符串, 如:tag_key_matches=env&tag_key_matches=team。\n**约束限制**:\n支持批量查询多个标签,最多支持10个标签。\n**取值范围**:\n最小数量 1,最大数量 10\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_value_matches",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n需要匹配的包含该标签的资源,需要和tag_key_matches条件配合使用,tag_key_matches和tag_value_matches的元素个数需要一致,且标签顺序需要完全匹配,不支持空字符串, 如:tag_key_matches=env&tag_value_matches=prod。\n**约束限制**:\n支持批量查询多个标签,最多支持10个标签。\n**取值范围**:\n最小数量 1,最大数量 10\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_match_policy",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n标签匹配模式,仅针对tag_key_exists,tag_key_matches,tag_value_matches参数生效。\n- ALL: 若请求中包含tag_key_exists参数,查询规则为资源标签需要包含tag_key_exists中的所有元素,若请求中tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数存在,查询规则为资源标签需要包含所有tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数中指定的key-value对应的标签。\n- ANY: 若请求中包含tag_key_exists参数,查询规则为资源标签需要包含tag_key_exists中的任意一个元素,若请求中tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数存在,查询规则为资源标签需要包含tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数中任意一个key-value对应的标签。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n- ALL\n- ANY\n**默认取值**:\nALL",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "ALL",
              "ANY"
            ],
            "default": "ALL"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询成功,返回指定runtime的访问方式列表。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListCoreRuntimeEndpointsResponseBody"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误(如runtime_id格式错误等)。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunBadRequestError"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未授权(认证令牌缺失、无效或已过期)。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunUnauthorizedError"
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "禁止访问(认证后权限不足)。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunForbiddenError"
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求过于频繁(触发限流)。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunTooManyRequestsError"
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunInternalServerError"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "CoreRunErrorDetail": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误详情结构体。",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误码。",
          "minLength": 18,
          "maxLength": 18
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误信息。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 1024
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "error_code",
        "error_msg"
      ]
    },
    "CoreRunInternalServerError": {
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n服务器内部错误。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误码。",
          "enum": [
            "AgentArts.03000500"
          ],
          "example": "AgentArts.03000500"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误详细信息。",
          "example": "服务器内部错误,请稍后重试"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunVersionWeightResp": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n单个版本的权重配置。",
      "properties": {
        "version_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n版本名称。",
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,22}[a-z0-9]$",
          "minLength": 2,
          "maxLength": 24,
          "example": "v1.0.0"
        },
        "weight": {
          "type": "number",
          "format": "float",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n流量权重比例 (0.0 - 1.0)。",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1.0
        }
      }
    },
    "ListCoreRuntimeEndpointsResponseBody": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "total": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1000000,
              "description": "总记录数。",
              "example": 100
            },
            "items": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 0,
              "maxItems": 100,
              "description": "运行时访问方式对象列表。",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunRuntimeEndpoint"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "CoreRunTagsResp": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n标签配置列表。",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunTagItemResp"
      },
      "minItems": 0,
      "maxItems": 20
    },
    "CoreRunForbiddenError": {
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n禁止访问(认证后权限不足)。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误码。",
          "enum": [
            "AgentArts.03000403"
          ],
          "example": "AgentArts.03000403"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误详细信息。",
          "example": "无权访问该资源"
        },
        "coded_authorization_message": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 1024,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\nIAM5 当OpenAPI无权限时报错信息。",
          "example": "eyJlcnJvciI6ICJVbmF1dGhvcml6ZWQifQ=="
        },
        "details": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n依赖的下游服务错误信息列表。",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 10,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunErrorDetail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunRuntimeEndpoint": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n运行时访问方式数据结构。",
      "properties": {
        "runtime_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uuid",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 36,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n运行时ID。"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uuid",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 36,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n运行时访问方式ID。"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 2,
          "maxLength": 48,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n运行时访问方式名称。"
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 255,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n运行时访问方式描述。"
        },
        "created_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n创建时间。"
        },
        "updated_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n最后更新时间。"
        },
        "target_version_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 2,
          "maxLength": 24,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n目标版本名称。"
        },
        "routing_config": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunRoutingConfigurationResp"
        },
        "tags": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunTagsResp"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunTooManyRequestsError": {
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n请求过于频繁(触发限流)。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误码。",
          "enum": [
            "AgentArts.03000429"
          ],
          "example": "AgentArts.03000429"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误详细信息。",
          "example": "请求过于频繁,请稍后重试"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunUnauthorizedError": {
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n未授权(认证令牌缺失、无效或已过期)。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误码。",
          "enum": [
            "AgentArts.03000401"
          ],
          "example": "AgentArts.03000401"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误详细信息。",
          "example": "认证令牌已过期,请重新登录"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunBadRequestError": {
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n客户端请求参数错误。",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误码。",
          "enum": [
            "AgentArts.03000400"
          ],
          "example": "AgentArts.03000400"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n错误详细信息。",
          "example": "请求参数错误:name字段不能为空"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunRoutingConfigurationResp": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n智能体运行时访问方式的路由配置。",
      "properties": {
        "version_weights": {
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n运行时访问方式多版本权重配置。",
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 3,
          "minItems": 0,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/CoreRunVersionWeightResp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreRunTagItemResp": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "key",
        "value"
      ],
      "description": "**参数解释**:\n单个标签的数据结构。",
      "properties": {
        "key": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n标签键。"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 255,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n标签值。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {
    "RuntimeId": {
      "name": "runtime_id",
      "in": "path",
      "required": true,
      "description": "运行时ID,用于唯一标识一个Agent运行时实例。",
      "type": "string",
      "format": "uuid",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
    }
  },
  "host": "agentarts.cn-southwest-2.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": "/",
  "info_version": "v1",
  "method": "get",
  "uri": null
